9f93e269c0696ccbb3320a16.text:
{
  "headline": "Boca Raton Night Market Returns to Sanborn Square This Fall",
  "dek": "The seasonal downtown event features food, local art, music, and free shuttle service through December.",
  "body_md": "Downtown Boca Raton's open-air Night Market series is underway at Sanborn Square, located at 72 N Federal Hwy. Events run from 6–9 p.m. on select dates this season.\n\nThe monthly festival transforms the square with vendors offering traditional market fare like baked goods and sweet treats, alongside local artists and makers, with music filling the air. Upcoming dates for the series are Thursday, October 1, 2026, November 5, 2026, and a holiday-themed market on December 10, 2026.\n\nAttendees can take advantage of free rides to and from the Night Market with BocaConnect, the City's eco-friendly shuttle service, by downloading the Circuit App to request a ride.\n\n\"Our Night Markets are one of the best ways to experience everything that makes Boca Raton special — great food, local art, music, and a real sense of community,\" said Mayor Andy Thomson.\n\n\"We can't wait to welcome everyone back to Sanborn Square this season, especially for our holiday-themed market in December,\" Thomson added.",
  "beat": "community",
  "source_record_ids": [
    "ab7018ab-9a75-49b5-8943-abb9fb042419"
  ],
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Sanborn Square is located at 72 N Federal Hwy",
      "record_id": "ab7018ab-9a75-49b5-8943-abb9fb042419"
    },
    {
      "text": "Night Market events run from 6–9 p.m.",
      "record_id": "ab7018ab-9a75-49b5-8943-abb9fb042419"
    },
    {
      "text": "Upcoming dates for the series are Thursday, October 1, 2026, November 5, 2026, and December 10, 2026",
      "record_id": "ab7018ab-9a75-49b5-8943-abb9fb042419"
    },
    {
      "text": "Vendors offer traditional market fare like baked goods and sweet treats, alongside local artists and makers, with music filling the air",
      "record_id": "ab7018ab-9a75-49b5-8943-abb9fb042419"
    },
    {
      "text": "BocaConnect is the City's eco-friendly shuttle service",
      "record_id": "ab7018ab-9a75-49b5-8943-abb9fb042419"
    },
    {
      "text": "Attendees can download the Circuit App to request a free ride",
      "record_id": "ab7018ab-9a75-49b5-8943-abb9fb042419"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Our Night Markets are one of the best ways to experience everything that makes Boca Raton special — great food, local art, music, and a real sense of community,\" said Mayor Andy Thomson.",
      "record_id": "ab7018ab-9a75-49b5-8943-abb9fb042419"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"We can't wait to welcome everyone back to Sanborn Square this season, especially for our holiday-themed market in December,\"",
      "record_id": "ab7018ab-9a75-49b5-8943-abb9fb042419"
    }
  ]
}

