62f154ccc107607f82c13628.text:
{
  "headline": "Boca Raton to Host Red, White & Boca Veterans Event on Nov. 11",
  "dek": "The free community event at Mizner Park Amphitheater will honor local military veterans with live music, a car show and a marketplace.",
  "body_md": "The City of Boca Raton will host Red, White & Boca: A Veterans Day Celebration on Wednesday, Nov. 11, 2026, from 4 to 7 p.m. at the Mizner Park Amphitheater, located at 590 Plaza Real.\n\nThe free event honors veterans, their families, and community members. No registration is required. The afternoon will feature live music, inspiring speeches, a classic car show, a Veterans Marketplace, and food vendors.\n\nThe event begins at 4 p.m., followed by the Presentation of Colors and National Anthem at 4:45 p.m. Speeches are scheduled for 4:55 p.m. and 5:25 p.m. The Coastman Chorus will perform at 5:10 p.m., followed by announcements at 5:40 p.m. and a performance by Belladiva at 5:45 p.m.\n\nThe east lawn will host a classic car show featuring awards for Best of Show, Best Veteran-Owned, and more, with presentations at 6:45 p.m. A Veterans Marketplace will highlight local service organizations and veteran-owned small businesses. Interested businesses and organizations can apply online at myboca.us.\n\nBoca Raton is recognized as a Purple Heart City, a designation honoring military veterans who received the Purple Heart for bravery and valor in the line of duty.\n\nFor more information, visit myboca.us/1467/Veterans-Day.",
  "beat": "community",
  "source_record_ids": [
    "cb30910a-b656-45f0-8627-80fa17e6ae28"
  ],
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The City of Boca Raton will host Red, White & Boca: A Veterans Day Celebration on Wednesday, Nov. 11, 2026, from 4 to 7 p.m. at the Mizner Park Amphitheater, located at 590 Plaza Real.",
      "record_id": "cb30910a-b656-45f0-8627-80fa17e6ae28"
    },
    {
      "text": "The free event honors veterans, their families, and community members.",
      "record_id": "cb30910a-b656-45f0-8627-80fa17e6ae28"
    },
    {
      "text": "No registration is required.",
      "record_id": "cb30910a-b656-45f0-8627-80fa17e6ae28"
    },
    {
      "text": "The afternoon will feature live music, inspiring speeches, a classic car show, a Veterans Marketplace, and food vendors.",
      "record_id": "cb30910a-b656-45f0-8627-80fa17e6ae28"
    },
    {
      "text": "The event begins at 4 p.m., followed by the Presentation of Colors and National Anthem at 4:45 p.m.",
      "record_id": "cb30910a-b656-45f0-8627-80fa17e6ae28"
    },
    {
      "text": "Speeches are scheduled for 4:55 p.m. and 5:25 p.m.",
      "record_id": "cb30910a-b656-45f0-8627-80fa17e6ae28"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Coastman Chorus will perform at 5:10 p.m., followed by announcements at 5:40 p.m. and a performance by Belladiva at 5:45 p.m.",
      "record_id": "cb30910a-b656-45f0-8627-80fa17e6ae28"
    },
    {
      "text": "The east lawn will host a classic car show featuring awards for Best of Show, Best Veteran-Owned, and more, with presentations at 6:45 p.m.",
      "record_id": "cb30910a-b656-45f0-8627-80fa17e6ae28"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Veterans Marketplace will highlight local service organizations and veteran-owned small businesses.",
      "record_id": "cb30910a-b656-45f0-8627-80fa17e6ae28"
    },
    {
      "text": "Interested businesses and organizations can apply online at myboca.us.",
      "record_id": "cb30910a-b656-45f0-8627-80fa17e6ae28"
    },
    {
      "text": "Boca Raton is recognized as a Purple Heart City, a designation honoring military veterans who received the Purple Heart for bravery and valor in the line of duty.",
      "record_id": "cb30910a-b656-45f0-8627-80fa17e6ae28"
    },
    {
      "text": "For more information, visit myboca.us/1467/Veterans-Day.",
      "record_id": "cb30910a-b656-45f0-8627-80fa17e6ae28"
    }
  ]
}

