c2ead1979a0a7e0e7b7bb025.text:
{
  "headline": "Glades Road Lane Closures Scheduled for Utility Work Starting Oct. 26",
  "dek": "Eastbound lanes between NW 2nd Avenue and NW 5th Avenue will close nightly for water main replacement.",
  "body_md": "Motorists traveling through Boca Raton should expect overnight lane closures on Glades Road beginning Monday, Oct. 26, 2026, as crews begin a water main replacement project.\n\nThe City of Boca Raton Utility Services Department announced that the two eastbound lanes of Glades Road between NW 2nd Avenue and NW 5th Avenue will close from 9 p.m. to 5 a.m. nightly, running Monday, Oct. 26 through Friday, Oct. 30, 2026. Crews will be replacing a 16-inch water main during the scheduled overnight hours.\n\nWhile the closures are in effect, one eastbound lane will remain open to traffic. Message boards will be placed in advance of the work zone to warn motorists. Drivers are encouraged to use Palmetto Park Road as an alternate route to avoid delays.\n\nCity officials noted that work schedules may change because of weather conditions.\n\nAnyone with questions about the project can direct them to Utility Services at 561-338-7310.",
  "beat": "government",
  "source_record_ids": [
    "14c7956f-41f6-4f68-8028-fb744d1f9fbf"
  ],
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Glades Road lane closures for utility work begin Oct. 26, 2026",
      "record_id": "14c7956f-41f6-4f68-8028-fb744d1f9fbf"
    },
    {
      "text": "The City of Boca Raton Utility Services Department advises the closures",
      "record_id": "14c7956f-41f6-4f68-8028-fb744d1f9fbf"
    },
    {
      "text": "The two eastbound lanes of Glades Road between NW 2nd Avenue and NW 5th Avenue will close",
      "record_id": "14c7956f-41f6-4f68-8028-fb744d1f9fbf"
    },
    {
      "text": "Closures are from 9 p.m. to 5 a.m. nightly",
      "record_id": "14c7956f-41f6-4f68-8028-fb744d1f9fbf"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dates are Monday, Oct. 26 through Friday, Oct. 30, 2026",
      "record_id": "14c7956f-41f6-4f68-8028-fb744d1f9fbf"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crews are replacing a 16-inch water main",
      "record_id": "14c7956f-41f6-4f68-8028-fb744d1f9fbf"
    },
    {
      "text": "One eastbound lane will remain open",
      "record_id": "14c7956f-41f6-4f68-8028-fb744d1f9fbf"
    },
    {
      "text": "Message boards will be placed in advance of the work zone",
      "record_id": "14c7956f-41f6-4f68-8028-fb744d1f9fbf"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drivers are encouraged to use Palmetto Park Road as an alternate route",
      "record_id": "14c7956f-41f6-4f68-8028-fb744d1f9fbf"
    },
    {
      "text": "Work schedules may change because of weather",
