  "headline": "Boca Raton Education Advisory Board to Meet Nov. 4",
  "dek": "The upcoming meeting will feature presentations on after-school enrollment and an internship partnership, along with a vote on the 2027 calendar.",
  "body_md": "The City of Boca Raton Education Advisory Board is scheduled to hold its regular meeting on Wednesday, Nov. 4, 2026. The session is set to begin at 5:30 p.m. in the Community Room at City Hall, located at 201 W. Palmetto Park Road.\n\nThe evening's agenda includes a presentation on the City's after-school program enrollment for the 2026-27 school year. Additionally, the board will review an update regarding the Boca Raton Innovation Campus internship partnership and will hold a vote on the board's 2027 meeting calendar.\n\nResidents are invited to attend, as all meetings are open to the public. Those who wish to speak during the public comment period may do so by filling out a comment card at the meeting.\n\nThe agenda will be posted on the City's website at least 72 hours before the meeting.",
