{
  "headline": "Mayor Andy Thomson cuts ribbon for new Crumb & Co. Bakery",
  "dek": "The new bakery located at 2200 N. Federal Highway employs 12 people and is open Tuesday through Sunday.",
  "body_md": "Mayor Andy Thomson joined owners Elena and David Moreau for a ribbon cutting on Friday, Oct. 9, 2026, at the bakery's new location at 2200 N. Federal Highway, Suite 104.\n\nCrumb & Co. Bakery employs 12 people and operates Tuesday through Sunday from 7 a.m. to 3 p.m.\n\nThe City of Boca Raton Office of Economic Development assisted the business through the City's Business Ambassador program, which guides new businesses through permitting and licensing.\n\nBusinesses interested in the program may contact the Office of Economic Development at 561-393-7761.",
  "beat": "business",
  "source_record_ids": [
    "9808dad4-3599-4a1f-8e3a-385e1b72597f"
  ],
