{
  "headline": "Grand Theft Charge Dropped Against Boca Raton Man",
  "dek": "The investigation into the theft of watches from a Mizner Park jewelry store remains open, according to police.",
  "body_md": "The Office of the State Attorney for the 15th Judicial Circuit has dropped a grand theft charge against a Boca Raton man who was previously arrested in connection with a watch theft at a Mizner Park jewelry store.\n\nBoca Raton Police Services was notified on Wednesday, Oct. 14, 2026, that the charge against Mark Delaney, 34, of Boca Raton, was dropped. Delaney had been arrested on Oct. 8 in connection with the theft of watches from a jewelry store located in Mizner Park.\n\nAccording to police, the State Attorney's Office filed a notice of nolle prosequi in the matter.\n\nAuthorities stated that the investigation into the theft remains open. Police are asking anyone who may have information about the incident to contact Detective Sgt. Ana Ruiz. She can be reached by phone at 561-338-1302.\n\nThe update regarding the case was released by the Boca Raton Police Services Public Information Office.",
  "beat": "public-safety",
  "source_record_ids": [
    "b90b7401-c17a-47e1-8f92-79f34d9ca2bc"
  ],
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Boca Raton Police Services was notified on Wednesday, Oct. 14, 2026, that the Office of the State Attorney for the 15th Judicial Circuit has dropped the grand theft charge against Mark Delaney",
      "record_id": "b90b7401-c17a-47e1-8f92-79f34d9ca2bc"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark Delaney is 34 and of Boca Raton",
      "record_id": "b90b7401-c17a-47e1-8f92-79f34d9ca2bc"
    },
    {
      "text": "Delaney was arrested Oct. 8 in connection with the theft of watches from a jewelry store in Mizner Park",
      "record_id": "b90b7401-c17a-47e1-8f92-79f34d9ca2bc"
    },
    {
      "text": "The State Attorney's Office filed a notice of nolle prosequi",
      "record_id": "b90b7401-c17a-47e1-8f92-79f34d9ca2bc"
    },
    {
      "text": "The investigation into the theft remains open",
      "record_id": "b90b7401-c17a-47e1-8f92-79f34d9ca2bc"
    },
    {
      "text": "Anyone with information may call Detective Sgt. Ana Ruiz at 561-338-1302",
      "record_id": "b90b7401-c17a-47e1-8f92-79f34d9ca2bc"
    },
    {
      "text": "This release is issued by Boca Raton Police Services Public Information Office",
      "record_id": "b90b7401-c17a-47e1-8f92-79f34d9ca2bc"
    }
  ]
}

